// # LSP CI Workflows
//
// Logline: Hostile probes then auto-release on push to main. Version is the git tag, not a VERSION file.
//
// Setup: Structural. ci.yml is YAML consumed by GitHub Actions.
//
// Beats:
//   1. probes checks out lsp, std, oodac, and oodar; require the oodac binary; oodac build (LLVM IR + clang + oodar) runs 33 probes.
//   2. build and blackbox-gate run with probes; auto-release runs only after those pass.
